  "Scenes.Fera.ExploreFerasWonderland.WellThatWasNice": "[pg]Well, that was nice, but you don't see much reason to stick around. You turn to head back to camp with a wistful look over your shoulder."
  "Scenes.Fera.ExploreFerasWonderland.WithThatAccomplished": ", and with that accomplished, you could head back to camp. Now, though, you'd rather stay; it smells and looks too good to leave this place. If you focus on your better sense, you could still attempt to leave{0}"
  "Scenes.Fera.ExploreFerasWonderland.WondrousAromaGuides": "[pg]That wondrous aroma guides you deeper, threading past delicate honeysuckles and crimson-colored lotus flowers. Sometimes, you have you to stop and turn your head this way and that, testing the air with quick breaths to determine which way you must go to chase the increasingly omnipresent odor. Other times it seems as obvious as a gold-plated path, dragging you right past vibrant foliage and smells that would normally incite you to stop and smell the roses if you weren't so focused on this one, heavenly, nose-tickling smell."
