  "Scenes.Fera.FeraAkbalGetQuest.AkbalSheSaysYes": "Akbal, she says? Why yes, you do believe you are familiar. If you recall correctly, he's the bitch-kitty you've been knocking around every time you meet him. A cursed demon, was he? His current form seems more fitting seeing as he's such a <i>pussy</i>."
